@anon.9bf146a73cb71d9c7e3fe69f46c42f4a.711 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [510 x i8] }> <{ [510 x i8] c"The caption of a figure. This element can be used in set and show rules to\0Acustomize the appearance of captions for all figures or figures of a\0Aspecific kind.\0A\0AIn addition to its `pos` and `body`, the `caption` also provides the\0Afigure's `kind`, `supplement`, `counter`, and `numbering` as fields. These\0Aparts can be used in [`where`]($function.where) selectors and show rules to\0Abuild a completely custom caption.\0A\0A```example\0A#show figure.caption: emph\0A\0A#figure(\0A  rect[Hello],\0A  caption: [A rectangle],\0A)\0A```" }>, align 1
